{"id":"nave:beth-shemesh","source":"nave","name":"Beth-Shemesh","slug":"beth-shemesh","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. A priestly city of the tribe of Dan Jos 21:16; 1Sa 6:15; 1Ch 6:59","refs":[["Josh",21,16,21,16],["1Sam",6,15,6,15],["1Chr",6,59,6,59]]},{"text":"On the northern border of territory of the tribe of Judah Jos 15:10; 1Sa 6:9,12","refs":[["Josh",15,10,15,10],["1Sam",6,9,6,9],["1Sam",6,12,6,12]]},{"text":"In later times transferred to the tribe of Judah 2Ki 14:11","refs":[["2Kgs",14,11,14,11]]},{"text":"Mentioned in Solomon’s commission districts 1Ki 4:9","refs":[["1Kgs",4,9,4,9]]},{"text":"Amaziah taken prisoner at 2Ki 14:11-13; 2Ch 25:21-23","refs":[["2Kgs",14,11,14,13],["2Chr",25,21,25,23]]},{"text":"Retaken by the Philistines 2Ch 28:18","refs":[["2Chr",28,18,28,18]]},{"text":"Called BETH-SHMESH Jos 19:41","refs":[["Josh",19,41,19,41]]},{"text":"2. A city near Jerusalem Jos 19:22","refs":[["Josh",19,22,19,22]]},{"text":"3. A fortified city of the territory of the tribe of Naphtali Jos 19:38; Jud 1:33","refs":[["Josh",19,38,19,38],["Judg",1,33,1,33]]},{"text":"4. An idolatrous temple Jer 43:13","refs":[["Jer",43,13,43,13]]}],"refCount":16}
